<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text">&nbsp;</p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text">According to Circana, 25&ndash;34-year-olds are the most likely to enjoy pumpkin-flavored coffee, proving the season&#39;s signature sip is going strong.</p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text">&nbsp;</p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text">Are you team &ldquo;too early&rdquo; or &ldquo;right on time&rdquo;?</p></div><!--/$--></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lvo3teaf_r_comp-mfd8dmqw" class="comp-lvo3teaf_r_comp-mfd8dmqw" data-semantic-classname="button" dir="inherit"><a data-testid="linkElement" href="https://www.circana.com/solutions/complete-food-and-beverage" target="_self" class="WZxFET comp-lvo3teaf_r_comp-mfd8dmqw-styleId__root wixui-button OOhWpA" aria-label="Complete Food &amp; Beverage"><span class="UPWJFm"><span class="QeinDR wixui-button__label" data-testid="stylablebutton-label">Complete Food &amp; Beverage</span><span class="vwUNxR wixui-button__icon" aria-hidden="true" data-testid="stylablebutton-icon"><span>
